The official audio of "I Never Loved a Man (The Way I Love You)" by Aretha Franklin from the album 'I Never Loved a Man the Way I Love You' (1967). "I Never Loved a Man (The Way I Love You)" was Aretha's first big hit and reached No. 1 on the Billboard Hot R&B chart.

